id: DRAFT-libyuv-ohos-simd-dispatch
draft: true
contributor_id: Theresa
title: Keep optional SIMD call sites aligned with compiled implementation objects
trigger_tool: cmake|clang|ld.lld
phase: linking
error_signature: undefined symbol: (MergeUVRow|YUY2ToUVRow|ARGBToYMatrixRow)_(NEON|SVE|SVE2)
severity: 3
category: cmake|arm-neon|source-selection|linking|fallback
match_keywords: libyuv,CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR,NEON,SVE,SVE2,undefined symbol,generic implementation
root_cause: The target compiler enabled AArch64 SIMD call sites while the CMake-generated target omitted matching NEON and SVE implementation objects, so the final link referenced symbols that no compiled object defined.
affected_scope: CMake libraries on OHOS aarch64 whose preprocessor dispatch and architecture-specific source selection use different capability signals.
verification_cmd: Run the failing link baseline, disable LIBYUV_DISABLE_NEON LIBYUV_DISABLE_SVE LIBYUV_DISABLE_SVE2 together, then execute libyuv_unittest and the installed-package consumer.
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: aligned-generic-simd-fallback
rec_description: When optional SIMD implementation objects cannot be selected reliably, disable the corresponding declarations and dispatch call sites together so the generic implementation remains linkable and functionally testable.
rec_command:
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: capability-backed-source-selection
fallback_description: Prefer compiling the complete architecture implementation source set after a target-compiler capability probe when accelerated kernels are required.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: manual
forbid_1_pattern: ignore.*undefined symbol|disable.*linker.*error|CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR.*without.*object
forbid_1_reason: Suppressing the link failure or changing only processor metadata does not prove that every enabled dispatch symbol has a compiled implementation.
forbid_1_consequence: Command-line tools or consumers fail at final link, or accelerated paths remain unverified.
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to: E266
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libyuv-ohos-simd-dispatch.md
last_updated: 2026-09-26
source_event: libyuv 0.0.1949.20260706 OHOS aarch64 adaptation; archives/l/libyuv/0.0.1949.20260706/reports/knowledge-evidence.md
authors: Theresa <ylinzixuan@qq.com>
